OL,3,GNEWSAEngland Cerebral Palsy World Cup
OL,4,Awin 'unbelievable'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking after the win, Baker - who has
OL,7,Frepresented his country at more than 10
OL,8,Fmajor competitions - said the triumph
OL,9,F"hasn't really sunk in yet".
